# Augury Raven's foretell {1}{U} (CR 702.143a): on turn 1 Augury Raven is foretold for exactly {2}, Blasted Landscape's {C}
# and Mox Emerald's {G} (the pool ends empty). On turn 3, with those two again - as much mana as the foretell cost, one {U}
# fewer - it can't be cast from exile, so the cost's {U} is pinned; then it is cast from exile for its foretell cost paid
# exactly with Blasted Landscape's {C} for the generic and Mox Sapphire's {U}, the pool ending empty (colorless mana for the
# generic leaves no room for another colored pip).

